# Preview Format

## Summary
Host command — open code mode, navigate to a module, set preview panel to isolated view, and show a card in the specified format.. Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import PreviewFormatTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/preview-format';

let result = await new PreviewFormatTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Preview Format).
